                        "entry_id": "52040ca5-5387-35bb-acd4-b6aaeb7262a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The position or job of being an editor"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a6b715e-bd33-4b88-9ad0-988dde0c7f25",
                                "sense_id": "dc73e24c-210e-3b26-b710-fbc04dd170d3",
                                "text": "With this issue Mr. W. A. Willox regretfully relinquishes the editorship of THE RAILWAY MAGAZINE"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc2c90c1-1de6-4a5f-980c-bc513f5e4c57",
                                "sense_id": "dc73e24c-210e-3b26-b710-fbc04dd170d3",
                                "text": "While this was tremendous fun, the week also revealed the limitations and sometimes bumpy consequences of the guest editorships."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb9b620e-703a-44de-80fd-59f564620759",
                                "sense_id": "dc73e24c-210e-3b26-b710-fbc04dd170d3",
                                "text": "Peter gained his first editorship with Motor Cycle, before joining EMAP to eventually edit Motor Cycle Mechanics (later Performance Bikes and now Practical Sportsbikes) in 1978."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
